-- changelog rows 47 to 49, §15 rules 53 to 57; SRS DEC-72). Generated by `prisma migrate diff
-- --from-config-datasource --to-schema prisma/schema --script` against a database holding every
-- migration before it, then extended by hand for what the schema language cannot say.
--
-- What it lands: the enum `ijazah_request_status` and the table `ijazah_requests` (a teacher's
-- request, frozen at send, decided by an administrator; R-403, R-404); on `ijazahs`, the request it
-- was issued from, its issuer, the two printed names, the completion date, the rendering and the
-- sign-off (ADR 0019 D1, R-402, DEC-72); the table `session_reminders` (the reminder sweep's record,
-- R-407); `user_reports.enrollment_id` (R-408); `gender_flags.reason` and `report_id` (R-409). No
-- index beyond the foreign keys' plain indexes, the queue's `(status, created_at)` and the three
-- partial uniques of rules 53, 56 and 57 (ERD §14).
--
-- `ijazahs` and `gender_flags` held no row when this was written (a SELECT on each database before
-- it runs, data-model.md; B26's lesson), so their NOT NULL columns are added without a default.

